## What personal information we collect, and where it comes from

Most of the personal information we hold is given to us by you — when you book or hire a trailer, on a form at the branch, over the phone, by email or WhatsApp, or through our website. We collect only what we need to hire out, sell, service and recover trailers.

We collect contact, address, business, tow-vehicle and verification information needed to handle enquiries, arrange rentals, verify customers, process payments and refunds, and manage returns, damage, overdue trailers and outstanding amounts. We also keep relevant booking, payment and communication records, and customer-account information such as discounts, credit arrangements and restrictions.

If you supply an alternative contact, we collect their name, telephone number and relationship to you from you, to contact them if we cannot reach you about your rental. Please let them know and share this notice with them.

{% if answers.vehicle_registration %}We keep the registration number of the vehicle you use to tow the trailer. We use it to record which vehicle is towing which trailer, and to trace a trailer that is not returned.{% endif %}

{% if answers.id_documents %}If you give us a copy of your identity document or driver's licence for verification, we keep it only until the verification is done and the hire is closed and settled.{% endif %}

{% if answers.cctv %}Some of our branches are covered by closed-circuit television (CCTV){% if cctv_branches %}: {{ cctv_branches|join(', ') }}{% endif %}. Where cameras are used, we record images of the yard and entrance for the security of our property and of people on our premises{% if cctv_signage %}, and signage at the branch tells you that recording is taking place{% endif %}. Footage is kept for a short rolling period, and kept longer only where an incident makes a specific recording evidence.{% endif %}

{% if answers.under_18 %}We do not knowingly collect the personal information of children (under 18) without the consent of a competent person, and our rentals are not aimed at children.{% endif %}

{% if answers.credit_checks %}Where we need to, we may obtain a credit check or reference check about you from a credit bureau or from a reference you give us. We will tell you what we received and who gave it to us if you ask.{% endif %}

## Why we collect it

We collect your personal information to quote, book, hire out, return and service trailers; to record which vehicle is towing which trailer; to invoice you and take payment; to contact you about your hire; and to keep the records the law requires us to keep.

Giving us your information is **voluntary**. But if you do not give us the details we need, we may not be able to hire a trailer to you, invoice you, or refund a deposit. Where the law requires us to collect something, we will say so at the time.

We process your personal information in terms of the **Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA)**. We are also required by law to keep certain records, including tax, VAT and accounting records (the **Tax Administration Act**) and company records (the **Companies Act**), for the periods those laws set.

## Who we share your information with

We share your personal information only with the following categories of recipients, and only as far as needed:

- our service providers who run the system for us (hosting, database, email and messaging providers), who may see your information only to provide that service;
{% if answers.card_payments %}- payment and banking providers, to process card and electronic payments and refunds;{% endif %}
{% if answers.service_providers %}- our accountant, IT support and other providers, who may see your information while doing their work for us;{% endif %}
{% if answers.share_info %}- debt collectors, tracing agents, insurers, assessors and attorneys, if money is owed to us, a claim arises, or our property is not returned;{% endif %}
- law enforcement, the Information Regulator, SARS and other authorities, where the law requires or permits it;
- your alternative contact, if we cannot reach you about a trailer that is due back.

We do not sell your personal information.

## Sending your information outside South Africa

The production cloud booking service processes information outside South Africa, with database hosting in **Ireland (European Union)** and application hosting in **Oregon, United States**. EU data-protection law protects information processed in Ireland; US protection depends on applicable provider contracts rather than an equivalent general privacy law. Overseas recipients must provide safeguards substantially equivalent to the protection required by POPIA, including protection for onward transfers.

## How long we keep it

We use reasonable safeguards and keep information only for as long as needed for the stated purposes, applicable legal obligations or unresolved claims. Tax and accounting record obligations arise under the **Tax Administration Act**, and company-record obligations under the **Companies Act** where applicable. We then securely delete it or remove identifying details. These record-keeping duties do not make every requested field legally compulsory.

## Your rights

You have the right to:

- be told that we hold your information and what we do with it;
- ask to see (access) the personal information we hold about you;
- ask us to correct or delete information that is inaccurate, out of date, or that we are no longer allowed to keep;
- object to our use of your information, on reasonable grounds;
{% if answers.marketing %}- opt out of marketing at any time;{% endif %}
- complain to the Information Regulator.

To use any of these rights, email {{ contact_email }} or write to us at {{ address }}. We will ask you to prove who you are first, and will respond within a reasonable time.

{% if answers.marketing %}## Marketing

Marketing is optional and separate from your registration or booking. We send electronic marketing only with valid consent or under POPIA's existing-customer exception for our own similar products, with an opt-out opportunity at collection and in every message. You can opt out at any time.{% endif %}

